Experiment: Convert Text Message to Audio in Android
AIM
To develop an Android application that converts a text message into speech using the Text-to-Speech (TTS) engine.
Algorithm
1.	Start the Android application. 
2.	Create an EditText to enter the text message. 
3.	Create a Button to convert the text into speech. 
4.	Initialize the TextToSpeech engine. 
5.	Read the text entered by the user. 
6.	When the button is clicked, pass the text to the TextToSpeech engine. 
7.	The device speaks the entered text aloud. 
8.	Stop and release the TextToSpeech engine when the application closes. 
